{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/d2fc3ae9b7173393ed904be33b71b85f.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>TinyCraft Town</strong> is a simple 2D pixel art survival game focused on light resource management, crafting, and exploration. Gather materials, cook food, fish, build workstations, craft weapons and gear, and restore a small ruined village. Inspired by games like RuneScape, Valheim, and Conan Exiles\u2014without the complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>relaxing crafting sim</strong> with satisfying progression, cozy visuals, and no pressure \u2014 just you, your tools, and a world to rebuild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.poster.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.webm?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.mp4?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.poster.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.webm?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.mp4?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/c454ff4d6c670fad4388c5396d968bd2.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 What will you do?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gather &amp; Craft</strong> \u2013 Chop wood, mine ores, and create workstations and tools to fuel your progress.<br>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Rebuild the Town</strong> \u2013 Fix abandoned buildings to unlock new features, recipes, and characters.<br>\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Explore &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Discover new lands and resources as you repair bridges, docks, and passageways.<br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Strategic Resource Flow</strong> \u2013 Optimize your village's productivity and balance your economy.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Chill Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A cozy pixel world with a soothing soundtrack, perfect for relaxed play sessions.<br>\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Early Access Evolving World</strong> \u2013 Frequent content updates and new systems on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games like <strong>Forager</strong>, <strong>Travellers Rest</strong>, or <strong>Stardew Valley</strong>, but want something more <strong>focused on crafting and calm progression</strong>, TinyCraft Town is the perfect escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf0 Whether you're here to optimize or just to unwind \u2014 your village awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for your visit! I'm a solo indie game developer and I am doing my best to improve the game based on the community feedback. By purchasing the game you are encoraging me to keep making games even better. Best wishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Village!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/2402c03541935eb1683bdda423d07e80d4654a4a.jpg"},{"name":"Getting to Work!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/d06e4e5b6a7602cc57079bac969726a9b3a38cc3.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/69ac02444987a20d564467ae3672246a0d344988.jpg"},{"name":"Town Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/95f3390ef6bf23a8832894c225389dfa58d318e6.jpg"},{"name":"Riches of the Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/f537d68d9263db4998c097c1bc55c4006e68d63f.jpg"},{"name":"Master Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/fbb9e38eecfecd2b4d64b847f43d6116737140e8.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/7e7864b9bad423950fad60cb55311ceb444b889c.jpg"},{"name":"Small Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/a35f0c00e2827956fd4f223c6194044c23d617ee.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/302aba5d58ad7582e7519cba92ea74298a5aa831.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314780/14abe67e4f5a97ec2c7f42cbcc48193a46c8a06a.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314780?t=1758393080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/6ebd069d04059fb24bc927081a69f37c851dbdb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758393080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/bf3bc85b7b151c94e1626bca59c0f56b15f30fd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758393080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/bf3bc85b7b151c94e1626bca59c0f56b15f30fd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758393080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3339610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/d2fc3ae9b7173393ed904be33b71b85f.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>TinyCraft Town</strong> is a simple 2D pixel art survival game focused on light resource management, crafting, and exploration. Gather materials, cook food, fish, build workstations, craft weapons and gear, and restore a small ruined village. Inspired by games like RuneScape, Valheim, and Conan Exiles\u2014without the complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>relaxing crafting sim</strong> with satisfying progression, cozy visuals, and no pressure \u2014 just you, your tools, and a world to rebuild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.poster.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.webm?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/cef1666645eef0c5814460dd278f52cb.mp4?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.poster.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.webm?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/56290debc8c1c71389b54df55d6047bc.mp4?t=1758393080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/extras/c454ff4d6c670fad4388c5396d968bd2.avif?t=1758393080\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 What will you do?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gather &amp; Craft</strong> \u2013 Chop wood, mine ores, and create workstations and tools to fuel your progress.<br>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f <strong>Rebuild the Town</strong> \u2013 Fix abandoned buildings to unlock new features, recipes, and characters.<br>\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Explore &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Discover new lands and resources as you repair bridges, docks, and passageways.<br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Strategic Resource Flow</strong> \u2013 Optimize your village's productivity and balance your economy.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Chill Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 A cozy pixel world with a soothing soundtrack, perfect for relaxed play sessions.<br>\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Early Access Evolving World</strong> \u2013 Frequent content updates and new systems on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games like <strong>Forager</strong>, <strong>Travellers Rest</strong>, or <strong>Stardew Valley</strong>, but want something more <strong>focused on crafting and calm progression</strong>, TinyCraft Town is the perfect escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf0 Whether you're here to optimize or just to unwind \u2014 your village awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much for your visit! I'm a solo indie game developer and I am doing my best to improve the game based on the community feedback. By purchasing the game you are encoraging me to keep making games even better. Best wishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Overaction Game Studio","ReiVax"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314780/header.jpg?t=1758393080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Even slower systems run the game.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.7.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Even slower systems run the game.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3314780/1041903056/1608255b8750c45ee56b931796